    "text": {
     "en": "In the token model a red token stands for minus 1 and a yellow token for plus 1. One red and one yellow together make zero.\nIntegers appear in lifts (floors above and below ground), temperatures, bank balances and sea level.\nAdding integers means putting tokens together and cancelling pairs."
    }
